{"findings": [{"type": "...", "affected_ids": ["..."], "claimed_amount_minor": 0, "currency": "...", "evidence_ids": ["..."], "explanation": "..."}]}
Use an empty list if the books are clean: every wrong finding costs reward, so report only errors the workbook proves. Use only ids that appear in the workbook. Keep explanations under 80 characters.

